    "description": {
      "value": "Juxtaposition ammunition quivers with anticipation, as if the projectile wishes to constantly be in motion. When an activated juxtaposition ammunition hits a creature, it doesn't deal the Strike's normal damage. Instead, the target must succeed at a DC 28 Will save or be teleported to a safe, unoccupied square of your choice within 60 feet of its original position and within the weapon's first range increment. On a critical failure, the target is also sickened 1 from the gut-wrenching sensation of sudden movement. Any relocation from the juxtaposition ammunition is forced movement.\n\nActivate (1 Action); Components Interact"
